@baseUrl = http://localhost:4002

### Anonymous contact submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sam Okoye",
  "email": "sam@example.test",
  "message": "I have a question about your business hours over the holidays.",
  "topic": "Support"
}

### 400: the public form validates the message before delivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "S",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "message": "Too short.",
  "topic": "Support"
}

### 400: numeric enum values are rejected
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sam Okoye",
  "email": "sam@example.test",
  "message": "This message is long enough for validation.",
  "topic": 99
}
